{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore working hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]][[cite:obs-b90a573bb0faa3351f4b4ae1917ae758d9ccf7d7 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"95599f78b5502ced097bf6c3a8a462f93868e193ae36501badd312db3464f557","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Added the core working hours as per the board resolution of 15 September 2026, noting that it overrides the staff handbook where they differ, with exact citations from both sources."}